&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You just graduated and you know you want a commercial career, but you&#39;re not sure which lane yet. Sales? Account management? Something else?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12 months inside Flexport&#39;s commercial engine. Four rotations, four mentors, one goal: find where you fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 1–3: Open doors as an SDR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 4–6: Manage clients as an Account Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 7–9: Close deals alongside a top salesperson&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 10–12: Go deep in Operations, Marketing, or Customs — your pick&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have a named 1:1 mentor each block, plus one programme-wide buddy who stays with you the entire year. You&#39;ll also build with low-code tools alongside our engineering team. Global trade runs on tech now, not just relationships.&amp;nbsp;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
